{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LED14rwsOm1795239700.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港鐵東涌綫下周六，來往東涌站會提早收車。<br/></p><p>為配合東涌東段波口工程，下周六東涌站開出，往香港站的尾班車，提早在晚上11時02分開出。香港站往東涌最遲一班，是在晚上11時07分，之後列車服務僅維持來往欣澳至香港站。</p><p></p><p>港鐵將在欣澳站，提供免費接駁巴士來往東涌站，並加派人手及指示，亦會確保翌日頭班車恢復正常服務。<br/><br/>機場快綫服務就不受影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.775547+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T05:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:37:13.506148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:19.643251+00:00","content_hash":"7b032d9775a9415d5a46567e750d1a99282106f63522d5005cfaf74c758a3d0f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.775547+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}